  "title": "Run AI at scale with Ray + Kubernetes using Anyscale on Azure",
  "description": "In this session see how to build multimodal data pipelines, train and fine-tune models, and deploy them as inference services, all without managing infrastructure. Walk through the end-to-end architecture and run a live demo of building, training, and serving AI inside your Azure subscription. Anyscale on Azure is a production-ready AI platform built on a scalable stack of Ray and Azure Kubernetes Service that abstracts the complexity of distributed compute behind a Python-native interface.",
